Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Add Cleanroom version list backed by GitHub Releases

Cleanroom (a Forge 1.12.2 fork) is not on the Prism meta server, so
fetch its releases from the GitHub API and expose the ones that ship
an MMC instance zip as a BaseVersionList.

